{
  "answer": "**答案:Willa(Raelle 的母亲)。** 第一季结局 \"Witchbomb\" 的最后几秒揭示她没有死。\n\n搜索结果里有些细节说得不清楚。比如有一条说 Scylla 在一所房子里发现了她,但我没能核实这个场景的细节。\n\n第一季结尾时,Raelle 和 Abigail 的存活要到第二季开头才确认。General Alder 还活着是第二季才揭示的,不是第一季结局。\n\nSources:\n- [‘Motherland: Fort Salem’ Creator On The Finale Bombshell, Raelle & Scylla’s Future & More Season 2 Scoop (Hollywood Life)](https://hollywoodlife.com/2020/05/20/motherland-fort-salem-season-2-spoilers-raelle-abigail-scylla-finale-interview)\n- [Motherland: Fort Salem finale recap (Show Snob)](https://showsnob.com/2020/05/21/motherland-fort-salem-finale-recap/)\n- [Motherland: Fort Salem Finale: Who Didn't Survive The Camarilla's Assault? (TVLine)](https://tvline.com/2021/08/24/motherland-fort-salem-recap-season-2-episode-10-alder-dead-alive)",
